│                          │ capacity for three-qubit gates.                                                           │
│                          │ 4. Keeping single-qubit RY rotations unshared to preserve per-qubit flexibility.          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This inductive bias leverages domain knowledge: winning lines are fundamental to          │
│                          │ tic-tac-toe, and three-qubit interactions can capture their correlations better than only │
│                          │ two-qubit nearest-neighbor gates. The architecture increases expressivity per parameter   │
│                          │ while reducing the generalization gap.                                                    │
