│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ winning_lines_zzz_augmentation                                                            │
│ patch_description        │ Augment the EfficientSU2-style ansatz with parametrized ZZZ (MultiRZ) gates on all 8      │
│                          │ tic-tac-toe winning lines. This directly encodes win-condition detection into the circuit │
│                          │ using the three-qubit gate vocabulary available in the motif-discovery extension.         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The 8 winning lines are:                                                                  │
│                          │ - Rows: (0,1,2), (7,8,3), (6,5,4)                                                         │
│                          │ - Columns: (0,7,6), (1,8,5), (2,3,4)                                                      │
│                          │ - Diagonals: (0,8,4), (2,8,6)                                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ By adding a shared ZZZ parameter on each line, the circuit can learn to recognize and     │
│                          │ amplify winning patterns. This is more parameter-efficient than adding arbitrary          │
│                          │ two-qubit gates and directly leverages the problem structure.                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Expected improvements:                                                                    │
│                          │ - Better test accuracy through domain-informed architecture                               │
│                          │ - Reduced validation loss via better feature extraction                                   │
│                          │ - Maintained parameter efficiency (only +8 params per block)                              │
│                          │ - Improved generalization by encoding game semantics                                      │
