│ patch_description        │ Introduce motif-aware three-qubit ZZZ interactions placed exactly on the eight            │
│                          │ tic-tac-toe winning lines to allow the circuit to directly detect triple correlations.    │
│                          │ Reduce parameter count and encourage symmetry/generalization by grouping single-qubit     │
│                          │ rotations: corners, edges, and center share RY parameters; pre- and post-RZ use a single  │
│                          │ shared parameter each. Add parametrized CRZ gates between the center (8) and its four     │
│                          │ adjacent edges to enable controlled phase conditioning of the center on edge qubits; the  │
│                          │ CRZs share a single parameter. Keep the CZ entangling lattice intact.                     │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Rationale:                                                                                │
│                          │ - ZZZ on winning lines gives an inductive bias for the task (detect three-in-a-row)       │
│                          │ without massively increasing parameter count by sharing the same "zzz_win" across lines.  │
│                          │ - Parameter sharing across symmetric qubit roles (corners vs edges vs center) reduces     │
│                          │ N_PARAMS and improves parameter_efficiency and generalization while retaining expressive  │
│                          │ power via repeated re-uploading and repeated blocks.                                      │
│                          │ - CRZs from center↔edges add useful conditional interactions focused on the central       │
│                          │ qubit, important for many win patterns.                                                   │
│                          │ - Keeps local CZ lattice to maintain short-range entanglement.                            │
│                          │ This change reduces N_PARAMS_PER_BLOCK from 27 -> 7 (N_PARAMS from 162 -> 42), while      │
│                          │ adding ZZZ motifs aligned to domain structure.                                            │
