│                          │ connecting center spokes; CRZs are adjacent and give directional coupling to the center   │
│                          │ while using one shared parameter.                                                         │
│                          │ - Keeping grid CZ entanglement but reordering slightly so motifs and entanglement         │
│                          │ interact naturally.                                                                       │
│                          │ Overall this reduces N_PARAMS substantially (from 25->10 per block), improving parameter  │
│                          │ efficiency and reducing overfitting while preserving motif-discovery capacity by          │
│                          │ explicitly allocating ZZZs to winning lines.                                              │
