│                          │ - Add shared parametric CRZ "spokes" between center and its neighbors (efficient center   │
│                          │ coupling).                                                                                │
│                          │ - Replace the many line-specific ZZZ parameters with a single shared "zzz_line" motif     │
│                          │ applied to all eight winning triples to encourage motif discovery while keeping parameter │
│                          │ efficiency.                                                                               │
│                          │ This matches a previously successful motif: lower unique parameter count (improves        │
│                          │ parameter efficiency and generalization) while preserving expressive, game-aligned        │
