│ patch_description        │ Replace the current shared-line, heavily-parameter-shared block with a symmetry-aware     │
│                          │ ansatz that:                                                                              │
│                          │ - Keeps lightweight symmetry-grouped single-qubit rotations (corners / edges / center)    │
│                          │ for parameter efficiency,                                                                 │
│                          │ - Preserves a CZ lattice backbone for robust entanglement propagation,                    │
│                          │ - Adds shared parametric center-edge CRZ couplings to let the center modulate edge        │
│                          │ information,                                                                              │
│                          │ - Splits the three-qubit ZZZ motif into geometric categories (row / column / diagonal) so │
│                          │ the circuit can detect different line types independently,                                │
│                          │ - Adds doubly-controlled diagonal CCRZ phases to complement diagonal ZZZ motifs,          │
│                          │ - Provides separate pre- and post- RZ phases (grouped by symmetry) to increase expressive │
│                          │ phase flexibility.                                                                        │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This design balances expressivity (targeted three-qubit motifs aligned to the game's      │
│                          │ winning triples) and parameter efficiency (symmetry grouping reduces redundant            │
│                          │ parameters). It reintroduces a motif arrangement that performed well in prior runs        │
│                          │ (improved validation/test accuracy and low generalization gap). The block keeps all gates │
│                          │ within connectivity rules and uses allowed gate types.                                    │
