│ patch_name               │ geometric_line_weighted_ansatz                                                            │
│ patch_description        │ This structural redesign improves upon the previous CCRZ-motif success by refining the    │
│                          │ parameter sharing strategy. Instead of a single 'ccrz_line' parameter, we subdivide the   │
│                          │ winning-line interactions into three distinct geometric categories: horizontal, vertical, │
│                          │ and diagonal. This allows the model to learn different weighting for these fundamental    │
│                          │ board symmetries. Additionally, we replace the generic 'crz_grid' with a directional      │
│                          │ 'crz_ring' and 'crz_spoke' structure to better capture the grid topology, and we utilize  │
│                          │ a more compact rotation layer at the end to improve parameter efficiency while            │
│                          │ maintaining high expressivity.                                                            │
