│ patch_name               │ enhanced_expressivity_ansatz                                                              │
│ patch_description        │ The current program achieves 0.72 test accuracy with 66 parameters. Analysis of prior     │
│                          │ programs shows that:                                                                      │
│                          │ 1. The seed program with 78 parameters achieved 0.74 test accuracy                        │
│                          │ 2. Better parameter sharing and strategic gate placement improve generalization           │
│                          │ 3. The current ansatz lacks sufficient three-qubit interactions on all winning lines      │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ Strategy: Enhance the ANSATZ_SPEC by:                                                     │
│                          │ 1. Adding ZZZ interactions on all 8 winning lines with differentiated parameters (not all │
│                          │ shared) to capture line-specific patterns                                                 │
│                          │ 2. Replacing some redundant RX gates with additional CRZ entanglement on center-to-edge   │
│                          │ connections                                                                               │
│                          │ 3. Adding pre-entanglement RZ rotations to improve phase control before two-qubit gates   │
│                          │ 4. Keeping parameter count reasonable through strategic sharing while increasing          │
│                          │ expressivity                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This approach increases parameters from 66 to ~72-75 (still reasonable) while improving   │
│                          │ the circuit's ability to learn winning-line-specific features, which should boost test    │
│                          │ accuracy closer to 0.74-0.76 range.                                                       │
