│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ shared-center-ccrz_and_rot_compression                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ Reduce parameter count and improve inductive bias by:                                     │
│                          │ - Sharing all center-edge CRZ couplings under a single "crz_center" parameter (was split  │
│                          │ NS/EW).                                                                                   │
│                          │ - Merging the four CCRZ centre/corner/edge controls into two symmetry groups:             │
│                          │ "ccrz_center" (edge-edge-center) and "ccrz_diag" (corner-corner-center).                  │
│                          │ - Replace the final per-wire RZ-only phase layer with compact two-step rotations RZ->RX   │
│                          │ that share a single "rot_*" parameter per symmetry group (corners/edges/center). This     │
│                          │ ties phase+axis rotation into a single learned angle, reducing redundant degrees of       │
│                          │ freedom while increasing expressive single-qubit local rotations.                         │
│                          │ These changes reduce N_PARAMS_PER_BLOCK from 16 to 13 (N_PARAMS from 96 to 78), matching  │
│                          │ a previously successful compact motif architecture. Fewer parameters should improve       │
│                          │ parameter efficiency and help generalization while preserving geometric/line motifs       │
│                          │ (ZZZ/CCRZ) important for tic-tac-toe structure.                                           │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0153                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
