│ patch_name               │ symmetry_shared_rz_and_crz_compression                                                    │
│ patch_description        │ Reduce overfitting and improve parameter efficiency by consolidating duplicate RZ         │
│                          │ parameters (pre/post) into a single symmetry-grouped RZ key used in both positions, and   │
│                          │ by merging the two CRZ edge-pair parameter keys into a single center-edge CRZ parameter.  │
│                          │ This reduces the number of unique parameters per block (and thus total parameters) while  │
│                          │ preserving the geometric symmetries and the motif-discovery ZZZ triple interactions       │
│                          │ aligned with winning lines. The change aims to lower model capacity slightly (reducing    │
│                          │ generalization gap) while keeping expressive motifs that capture winning-line             │
│                          │ correlations.                                                                             │
