│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ enhanced_entanglement_with_adaptive_phases                                                │
│ patch_description        │ The current program has a combined score of 0.70, which is lower than the prior programs  │
│                          │ (0.74). Analysis shows:                                                                   │
│                          │ - Test accuracy dropped from 0.78 to 0.74                                                 │
│                          │ - Validation loss increased from 1.68 to 1.88                                             │
│                          │ - Generalization gap increased from 0.02 to 0.06                                          │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The issue appears to be that the recent changes (merging crz_center into crz_ring,        │
│                          │ merging rot_edges/rot_center into rot_others, and adding phase layers) reduced            │
│                          │ expressiveness without sufficient benefit.                                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Proposed improvement:**                                                                 │
│                          │ Restore the separate parameter keys for better expressiveness while keeping the parameter │
│                          │ count at 13 per block (78 total):                                                         │
│                          │ 1. Restore `crz_center` as a separate parameter (was merged into crz_ring)                │
│                          │ 2. Restore `rot_edges` and `rot_center` as separate parameters (were merged into          │
│                          │ rot_others)                                                                               │
│                          │ 3. Remove the injected phase layer (phase_corners, phase_edges, phase_center) which added │
│                          │ 3 parameters                                                                              │
│                          │ 4. Consolidate CCRZ gates to use a single shared parameter                                │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This maintains 13 unique parameters per block while restoring the expressiveness that     │
│                          │ achieved 0.78 test accuracy in prior runs.                                                │
