│ patch_name               │ add_fixed_cz_entangling_between_crz_and_zzz                                               │
│ patch_description        │ Introduce fixed CZ entangling gates on every allowed grid edge immediately after the      │
│                          │ shared CRZ layer. The CZs add deterministic entanglement and cross-talk without           │
│                          │ increasing the number of trainable parameters, giving the subsequent three-qubit ZZZ/CCRZ │
│                          │ motifs richer correlated inputs to act on. This aims to improve expressivity and          │
│                          │ accelerate learning while preserving parameter efficiency and respecting connectivity     │
│                          │ constraints.                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The replacement only modifies ANSATZ_SPEC (inside the allowed EVOLVE block) and keeps all │
│                          │ existing parameter keys unchanged so N_PARAMS is the same. CZ gates are placed on each    │
│                          │ GRID_EDGE, inserted between the CRZ layer and the ZZZ motifs.                             │
